                                "sense_id": "b2752eab-82b5-3cb7-867c-0fd5c21f2bc2",
                                "text": "But ere I could enter three leaves into the Pamflet , (for I deferr the peasantly – rudenes , which by the Licencers leav , I met with afterwards"
